fn omega_cg_qmma_pack b edit ulong 8192 x view ulong 16 n ulong to void
off = mul n 8
for i ulong 6
put b add off i get x i
end
put b add off 6 or get x 6 shl get x 7 32
fl = or get x 8 or shl get x 9 1 shl get x 10 2
for i ulong 5
fl = or fl shl get x add i 11 add 16 mul i 8
end
put b add off 7 fl
end

fn cg_qmma kind ulong a ulong c ulong d ulong b edit ulong 8192 m edit ulong 512 to ulong
s = new ulong 8 0
put s 0 kind
put s 1 a
put s 2 c
put s 3 and d 4294967295
put s 4 shr d 32
ret omega_cg_qmma_build s b m
end

